[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/Stats/AttributeSet.cs" id="1_attrset"]

; The oldest thing the player can pick a fight with: more health and armour than the Ash dragon, and
; the deepest mana pool in the game (it is a caster that has had centuries to practise). It does NOT
; out-damage the Ash dragon — LORE keeps "among the most dangerous enemies in the game" for the
; corrupted one. This is a wall that talks; that one is a knife.
;
; Broad resistances, and Arcane highest of all: a creature whose whole identity is knowledge is not
; going to be surprised by a spell. Fire and Frost are covered because it lives in the Reach and has
; met both dragons that share it with it. Nothing reaches immunity — CombatMath puts resistance on
; the armour curve precisely so no school is ever a trap (DESIGN).
[resource]
